msgid "Archived Topic: Attopilot 180A Voltage and Current Sensor"
msgstr "归档主题：Attopilot 180A 电压和电流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:8
#: 15112787bdd243bcaae03eeda832823f 8ac4a9e488614148b3dacb81e46b74f1
#: 9520c857fda641e59b3d50b8b5dca2e8 e08b53961a594a2abb5fdddc65e5d8c1
#: f9e14a284af54f6584da39f4b5d1b77b
msgid ""
"In general it is best to use a power module specifically designed to work "
"with autopilots but for cases where you need to measure over the voltage "
"limit (i.e. > 18V) or current limit (i.e. > 90Amps) of the available power "
"modules you may wish to use an `AttoPilot 180A current and voltage module "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__ which can be purchased from "
"`Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__."
msgstr ""
"通常最好使用专为飞控设计的电源模块，但对于需要超过可用电源模块的电压限制（即 > 18V）或电流限制（即 > 90A）的情况，可以使用 "
"`AttoPilot 180A 电流和电压模块 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__，可从 "
"`Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10644>`__ 购买。"

