#: 10df4d650e3b4493ba68e6adb68680a5 2ce1655d816544608656bdfb09c73c8f
#: 6005863fa47c42979e41af8ed36c97e8 ab6565f7916f44a79343f260a28af26c
#: db29843b761441229b98aa4756506364
msgid "Setup in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:30
#: 1767d36aae0a4be894df2eec222344c4 42b901b9761841b8a3f9a717964b0639
#: 63b4c69cb2a2444a97c4d451ed6b118b b5474614bc8f4d8aa7291db90a761105
#: d61f7c459a294ea4a426ed627857339f
msgid ""
"To configure the sensor go to the Mission Planner's INITIAL SETUP > Optional"
" Hardware > Battery Monitor page and set the \"Monitor\", \"Sensor\" and "
"\"APM\" fields as shown in the image below.  If a battery is then connected "
"you should see the \"Battery voltage (Calced)\" field become populated with "
"the voltage of the battery."
msgstr ""
"要配置传感器，请进入 Mission Planner 的 INITIAL SETUP > Optional Hardware > Battery "
"Monitor 页面，并如下图所示设置「Monitor」、「Sensor」和「APM」字段。连接电池后，您应该会看到「Battery voltage "
"(Calced)」字段显示电池电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:39
#: 56da86defffd4d87a533cd5a281a72fc 9cc14e0ded1546d1b27150c9b4e80d40
#: c70e9945fbd0417296d2e1702aea4dc4 ca89b4f85f6a412da75f1b69a298fef4
#: fa81b183bf1e4437a92efd6f290f5761
msgid ""
"Note: Due to the voltage scaling of the sensor to 3.3V, the maximum current "
"you can measure with the 180Amp sensor described here is actually 272Amps "
"and for the smaller `AttoPilot 90A sensor "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9028>`__ it is 136Amps."
msgstr ""
"注意：由于传感器电压缩放至 3.3V，此处描述的 180A 传感器实际可测量的最大电流为 272A，较小的 `AttoPilot 90A 传感器 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9028>`__ 为 136A。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:47
#: 24e07d061608459fa05d2e9e43bec5e1 2a109027333140e0b29ef107728317eb
#: 3eb3d06d2a3c4c50b5ad534068a188cf 64c2094b195e40179ea8362e7b5e1548
#: a49936c815eb422ca302586c6d575bd5
msgid "Calibrating the voltage sensor"
msgstr "校准电压传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-using-a-current-sensor.rst:49
#: 24b58558e2804ea8a005bd1892efa50a 4661a94066df407ea89c1689d8c46862
#: 51ca764634b1444c8b4cef787d70aecf 7f31c60caa6743ecb7ddfd33176424af
#: cbb09ebf0837411084baa3da92192dac
msgid ""
"You can calibrate the voltage sensor to match the voltage from a hand-held "
"volt meter by following the instructions on the power module calibration "
"page :ref:`here <common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"您可以按照电源模块校准页面 :ref:`此处 <common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-"
"planner>` 的说明，通过手持电压表将电压传感器校准到匹配值。"
